        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Dee-bid",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal rɔ̱ duɔ̱l Dee-bid kä Ɣɛb-ron, kä cukɛ wee, “Nɛnɛ, kɛ kɔn ri̱ŋdu kä riɛmdu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wal, cu mäni mi Thɔɔl ɛ kuäär ɛ, ɛ ji̱n ɛ nëë bo̱o̱th ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ko̱o̱r. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial ni Kuothdu ji̱ jiök i̱, ‘Bia̱ yieen nɛɛnikä ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä bia̱ rueecdiɛn.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu bööth I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ben kä kuäär kä Ɣɛb-ron. Kä cu Dee-bid ruac mat kɛ kɛ kä Ɣɛb-ron nhiam Kuɔth Nhial, kä cukɛ Dee-bid kuany ala kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl, nikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial mëë cɛ lat kɛ Tha-muɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm wä mak, min la Yɛ-buth, kä ciaŋ kɛ jɛ ɛ ji̱kɛ ni ji̱ Yɛ-buth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Yɛ-buth Dee-bid jiök i̱, “/Ci bi ben ɛn wa̱nɛ.” Duundɛ ɣöö cu Dee-bid wecdiɛn in bum ni Dha-yɔn ka̱n, min ci ku la wec Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wee i̱, “Ɛn ramɔ bi ji̱ Yɛ-buth näk ɔ kɛ nhiam ba kuäär kä ba bööth rɛ̈m.” Kä cu Yo-ab gat Dhɛ-ru-yaa wä kɛ nhiam, kä cua kuäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wä ciɛŋ ni wec mi bum bum. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cua jɛ cɔli wec Dee-bid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wec täth a go̱lɛ jɛ a känɛ jɛ ni kä Milo a go̱o̱lɛ jɛ. Kä cu Yo-ab duɔth wec buɔt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid buɔ̱m ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kɛ ɣöö te Kuoth Nhial in la Ruey Ɣɔaa kɛɛl kɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nɛɛ Dee-bid tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu ti̱ti̱ a kua̱r nɛɛni Dee-bid tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m, tëë ca luäk kɛ buɔ̱m kuäärädɛ, kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛ ɣöö ba kuäär, ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial kɛ kui̱ I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti̱ti̱ kɛ nɛɛ Dee-bid tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m. Ya-cɔ-bam raan rɛ̈ɛ̈k Ɣak-mo-ni, a bo̱o̱th nɛɛni ti jiɛɛn diɔ̱k. Cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ nɛy ti kur diɔ̱k kɛ mutdɛ kä cuɛ kɛ näk ɛn guäth ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ram in guur jɛ rɛy nɛɛni diɔ̱k tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m a Ɛl-a-dhar gat Do-day kä kuay Ä-ɣo-ɣi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tëë kɛɛl kɛ Dee-bid kä Pɛ̈th-dɛ̈-mim mëë mat ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt rɔ ɛn wi̱ni kɛ ko̱r, tëë rɛy kakä bɛɛl mëë bar ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ kɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cukɛ cuɔ̱ŋ däär kakä, cukɛ jɛ gaŋ, kä cukɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt näk. Cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ ka̱m juc nath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ cäŋ kɛl cu bööth diɔ̱k kä kua̱r bööthni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ diɔ̱k wä kä Dee-bid rɛy kɔ̱kä pääm Ä-du-lam, kä ci rɛm ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt pua̱t rɛy lo̱o̱lä ji̱ Rɛpa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wa̱nɔ te Dee-bid rɛy pa̱a̱m. Kä te buɔ̱n ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid pi̱ go̱r wëë i̱, “Aɣ duŋ mi tëë kɛ ram no̱ŋä pi̱ ti dëë math rɛy jiɛw in te thok wec kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu wutni ti bum da̱ŋ diɔ̱k rɛt ni wec ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt, kä cukɛ pi̱ wä jɔm rɛy jiɛw in te thok wec kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm, kä cukɛ kɛ nöŋ Dee-bid. Duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ math thi̱n. Cuɛ kɛ muɔc piny kämɛ kɛ Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wee i̱, “/A jɛ na̱n kɛ ɣä, ca nɛ mi dëë la̱t nhiam Kuɔthdä. /Cä riɛm nɛɛni ti̱ti̱ de̱e̱ math kɛ ɣöö ca thöp ni tëkdiɛn.” Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ /kenɛ kɛ math. Cua tɔ̱tɔ̱ la̱t ɛ wutni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k tin buɔ̱m buɔ̱ɔ̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu Ä-bi-cay däman Yo-ab a bo̱o̱th nɛɛni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. Cuɛ nyiëëny kɛ nɛy ti kur diɔ̱k kɛ mutdɛ, kä cuɛ kɛ näk, kä cu tekɛ kɛ̈k ce̱tkɛ nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu jɔɔc ni kɛ̈kdɛ ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, kä cua bo̱o̱thdiɛn. Duundɛ ɣöö /kenɛ la ram kɛl kä kɛn nɛy da̱ŋ diɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da a wääth ko̱o̱r kä Kɛ̈b-dhel, cuɛ nyin wääthä la̱t. Cuɛ wäth ko̱o̱r Mo-ab da̱ŋ rɛw näk. Kä cuɛ lony lɛ wä näk rɛy waŋ kɛ cäŋ nhial guiiyni mi cäät naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ raan rööl I-jëp mi di̱i̱t mi tekɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ dhieec kɛ bärɛ lɛni näk. Kä ɛn raan I-jëp tëë kɛ mut mi di̱i̱t. Duundɛ ɣöö cu Bɛ-na-yaa wä kä jɛ kɛ kɛɛt, kä cuɛ mut mac tetdä ran I-jëp, kä cuɛ jɛ näk kɛ mutdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tɔ̱tɔ̱ cua kɛ la̱t ɛ Bɛ-na-yaa gat Yɛ-ɣo-ya-da kä cuɛ tekɛ kɛ̈k ce̱tkɛ wutni ko̱o̱r da̱ŋ diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
